Package: backgammoncalculator
Title: Reusable Backgammon Analysis Tools
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marty", "Gale", email = "justsendityew@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(
      "Lasse", "Hjorth Madsen",
      role = "ctb",
      comment = "GNUID/XGID conversion concepts adapted from the bglab package"
    )
  )
Description: Provides reusable complete GNUID and XGID conversion through a canonical backgammon position model, plus calculations, statistical summaries, visual themes, and plot templates for backgammon analysis. Identifier conversion is implemented locally without invoking an engine or renderer.
